{"parse": {"title": "WFS-05", "pageid": 64966, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/WFS-04\" title=\"WFS-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">WFS-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/WFS-06\" title=\"WFS-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">WFS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.82.BD.E7.84.B0.E7.87.83.E7.83.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"炽焰燃烧\">炽焰燃烧</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 炽焰燃烧</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Burning Fire</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>火<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>滚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>烫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>责<span class=\"color-value\"></span>任<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>悄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>悄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>哼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>己<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>歌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191505</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>3月13日20:30，天气雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像所有恐怖电影中的定律一样，主角不会被立刻干掉，而是会被困在昏昏欲睡的状况里很长一段时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧接着她的记忆就会做出反应，让她知道自己是谁，人在哪里，随后重建整个记忆的实况，从而带来无情的恐惧感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而她的下一个念头，就是自己还活着，因此她得继续走下去，一切尚未结束。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiaoshulin_wan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiaoshulin_wan\"><img alt=\"jiaoshulin_wan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Cg-jiaoshulin_wan.png/600px-Cg-jiaoshulin_wan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Cg-jiaoshulin_wan.png/900px-Cg-jiaoshulin_wan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Cg-jiaoshulin_wan.png/1200px-Cg-jiaoshulin_wan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一双手臂从背后将她抱住，接着她的身体就被高举起来，她的双脚在空中无助地猛踢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306021.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306021.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巴蒂斯特的声音在她耳畔响起，先前那些攻击只让他昏迷了几分钟，根本没能完全让他失去行动能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂斯特：</div><div>很好，珍妮弗。你有渴望。你想活下去。我答应你，我一定会给你付清薪水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>放开我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿抬起手肘攻击男子的鼻梁，她听到嘎吱一声，男子双手松开，倒了下去。随后她朝着男子的大腿用力一跺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂斯特：</div><div>……见鬼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306019.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306019.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>车……我的车！必须赶快回去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听见血珠从手臂边缘滴下去时发出的轻微溅水声。不知道什么时候被树枝割伤了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的头里警铃大作，可是大脑实在负荷过度，她只想把它关掉。于是她不再思考，不再害怕，也不抱希望，只是跑，跑出森林，跑上公路。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye3\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye3.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye3.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye3.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306019.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306019.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>哈……哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自从逃掉了大学的体育测试后，她已经有很长的时间没有跑过这么长距离了，但这并不是她心脏狂跳的主要原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>麻木的冰冷感逐渐爬上双腿，手臂上的血迹提醒她邪恶尚未远去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她直起身，沿着这条幽灵公路继续跑下去，跑向暗夜中隐约可见的屋子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我的车！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸上冒着汗水，几绺发丝紧贴在前额上。她的手指紧张地摸索着钥匙，心扑通狂跳，不停分泌唾沫，几乎不敢呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金属撞击着金属。摩擦，静电，迸溅出火花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306019.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306019.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>上帝保佑，一定要能发动啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306019.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306019.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>冷静点！只要把钥匙对准……就可以……啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声剧烈的玻璃碎裂的声响打断了她的思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306021.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306021.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从所剩无几的后视镜碎片中瞥见巴蒂斯特一边挥动着金属尖头锤——那把用来将斯塔尔父子敲得皮绽骨碎的凶器——一边试图打开主驾驶的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>该死……他竟然这么快就追过来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>不能让他破坏车子！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她通过副驾驶的车门爬出车外，被门槛条绊倒在地。她暗自咒骂一声，眼角余光辨识出一个朝她跑来的白色人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-563512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-563512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-563512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>金蜜儿小姐！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>啧！你这小鬼——快进来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她以百米冲刺的速度跑至门口，拖着杰克一起回到旅馆大堂。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抓住门把。在那个瞬间，她脑中浮现出将门锁上的可能性，但那同时也意味着封死唯一的出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂斯特：</div><div>放弃吧，珍妮弗，过来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>谁要听你的鬼话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿忽然用力将门往前一推，弹开的门板把巴蒂斯特撞得滚下台阶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂斯特：</div><div>小杂种……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>跟紧我！杰克！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿绕过前台，直奔厨房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将挂在壁炉上的点三八口径左轮手枪塞进腰间，随后遵循指示标志转入另一条走道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>酒窖……酒窖就在这个方向……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xiashuidao\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xiashuidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiashuidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306019.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306019.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想起巴蒂斯特曾让她将送来的货物送入酒窖，忍不住一阵哆嗦。此时她就在这里，却已经无路可逃。这座酒窖只有唯一一个出入口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果这里不能成为巴蒂斯特的终点，那就只能成为她的墓室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>听着，杰克。等下他追过来的时候，我会尽力拖住他，你就趁机离开这里，去搬救兵，明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声巨响从门外传出，直接将门凿变了形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>他来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个声音再度响起，大约三声之后，她一瞥，看见门上被凿破的地方突然出现一只手，将门栓轻轻地拨开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿掏出左轮手枪射击，但巴蒂斯特的速度竟惊人的敏捷，他躲开子弹，随后直接撞开酒窖的门，巨大的冲击力使她连退几步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>见鬼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂斯特：</div><div>放弃吧，珍妮弗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>这句话你已经说过了，亲爱的老板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿深吸一口气，手指接触到冰冷坚硬的精钢枪身，旋转弹膛回到原位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-563511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-563511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-563511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>金蜜儿小姐……我们会死吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我们还远远没到穷途末路的境地呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂斯特：</div><div>你在跟谁说话？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>哪怕如今的你被称为公路杀手，被称为恶魔，我也会永远同情你这个该死的瞎子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿趁这一刻举起右手，瞄准巴蒂斯特脚下的酒液射击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火花迸溅，沿着酒液表面的纹理滑行，蔓延。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-563701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巴蒂斯特：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰愈发汹涌，顺着巴蒂斯特的裤脚一路向上攀爬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>就是现在！快跑！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>发生了什么事？！咳咳……麻布基特？你怎么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他四下张望，脸色被火光映照得通红。看到金蜜儿手中的枪，他迷蒙的双眼突然瞪得溜圆，好像终于记起了自己身在何处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>上帝！别朝我开枪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>旅馆起火了！快去看看其他房间里还有没有人！记得把剩下的人都带出去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汤姆：</div><div>那你呢？你去二楼做什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我答应了一个人要帮她……我最讨厌言而无信了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>我跟你一起去！金蜜儿小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰隆隆作响，在楼梯周边跳跃。金蜜儿停在24号房的门前，直接将钥匙插入锁孔，将门踢开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">朱迪：</div><div>上帝！你怎么能——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>朱迪女士！快跟我走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">朱迪：</div><div>我才不去！我哪里都不去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">朱迪：</div><div>这是什么味道？烟？斯塔尔！你竟然在这里纵火？你怎么能这么做？这对我们其他人公平吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿看向朱迪的眼睛，却只看见茫然失焦的眼神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一股巨大的热浪朝她的后背袭来，带着怒气般咆哮着。没有时间了。她一把抓起朱迪的手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我带你去体会真正的快乐，朱迪女士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>比“雪利酒”的滋味更美好的东西！你觉得它听起来怎么样？是不是更带劲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拉着朱迪奔下楼梯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>临行前她回望了一眼旅馆，火势熊熊地燃烧着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanwaijing_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿跑出旅馆，她钻进驾驶座，转动点火装置上的钥匙，车子的引擎发出三声怒吼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>终于发动了！还有半箱油，老天保佑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你们快上车！动作快些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杰克停在旅馆的门前一动不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……杰克？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>对不起……我不能跟你走了，金蜜儿小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>我要等爸爸和杰克回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>胡说八道！你不能这么没有契约精神！杰克！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>可是我只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我知道你是谁，杰克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>但不管你是谁，我都已经完成了你的请求，现在该轮到你完成我的了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将杰克拉进了车子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-563511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-563511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-563511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>金蜜儿小姐，你的手在流血……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>是啊。刚刚的游戏有点太激烈了——能帮我打个电话吗？杰克，号码是911。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-306017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我总得为这个故事画上句号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车子发出温和而有节奏的隆隆声响，驾驶座的窗户缝隙传出伊丽莎白·弗雷泽的歌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“无畏存在于我的呼吸间，如火焰中的热泪……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“黑夜犹如盛放的黑色花海，我在无边的黑暗中蹒跚而行……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燃烧的夜枭旅馆目送着车子加速驶离，露出如释重负的眼神。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "WFS-05"}}